  ],
  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math>. The first equation in the given system is <math alttext=\"x equals 8\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>8</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the second equation in the given system yields <math alttext=\"8 plus 3 y equals 26\"><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> from both sides of this equation yields <math alttext=\"3 y equals 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"y equals 6\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
